# Testing Patterns
- Unit tests: mock LLM providers, use in-memory SQLite
- Integration tests: use real SQLite in temp dir, mock external APIs
- E2E tests: full pipeline per vertical slice
- Name tests: test_{what}_{scenario}_{expected}
- Every provider needs a request-building test and a response-parsing test
